cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CurveMole in scientific work, please cite the exact release used."
title: "CurveMole: Modular Scientific Curve Fitting"
abstract: |-
  Official website: https://sebrolens.github.io/curvemole/
  Download the latest version: https://github.com/SebRoLENS/curvemole/releases/latest

  CurveMole is free, open-source desktop software for scientific curve fitting
  and data analysis on Windows, macOS and Linux. It supports nonlinear and
  global fitting, custom models, parameter constraints and uncertainty analysis.
  This Zenodo record preserves a specific release for citation and reproducibility.
keywords:
  - scientific curve fitting
  - nonlinear fitting
  - global fitting
  - data analysis
  - desktop software
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-10-23
authors:
